      "display": "PC-98 font ROM",
      "description": "The character ROM of an NEC PC-98 you own: 8x8, 8x16 and the 16x16 kanji.",
      "size": 288768,
      "name": "FONT.ROM",
      "label": "NEC PC-98 FONT.ROM",
      "requiredWhen": {
        "setting": "pc98FontRom",
